    <headline>Budhi Gandaki at Aarughat 8.43 m — above the 5.0 m danger level</headline>
    <description>DHM: Aarughat gauging station (index 445) read 8.43 m and rising at 8:40 AM on Asoj 25 (11 Oct 2026); warning level 4.5 m, danger level 5.0 m. The flood swept away the station and bridge at about 8:40 AM, so there are no further readings. It read 2.28 m at 6:00 AM and crossed the danger level at 7:50 AM.</description>
    <instruction>Stay in safe places away from the river and risky settlements. Avoid risky bridges and roads. Follow the local administration and security agencies.</instruction>
